{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_blst_097_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_blst_097_1004_009rit", "source_sha256": "6c4605a4aa38964b62d202a5318d1275f583f71fbaf9d951087d221c65cde9fd", "ja": "ライバル、商売敵ってことですよ！　そうなったら、\nさすがに今までみたいな関係じゃいられませんよね？", "zh": "所谓竞争对手，也就是生意上的敌人！要是变成那样，我们就不能再像以前那样相处了吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_blst_097_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_blst_097_1006_009rit", "source_sha256": "b71b9d7b28cde5d93bbe7236fc182b0ebefc736bcf4f74a34742096754020c8b", "ja": "劇場のみんなを相手にしなきゃいけなくなるのかな～。\nみんな、今も着々と力をつけてきてるし……。", "zh": "到时候就得和剧场的大家为敌了吧～。大家现在也在稳步变强……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_blst_097_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_blst_097_1007_009rit", "source_sha256": "20249adf16529cf35e6f7ef35725cdbf97cc8a7250ae61d6cd6abe2ef64fa748", "ja": "私も、劇場はすごく好きです。けど……。", "zh": "我也非常喜欢剧场。可是……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_blst_097_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_blst_097_1008_009rit", "source_sha256": "e902215ef9c147bf9c904491b3455a53d8ec0120c0526cb10b68ba76cce93591", "ja": "アイドルとして高みを目指していくなら、\nどんな形であれ、いつか戦わなきゃ……でしょ？", "zh": "如果要以偶像的身份不断追求更高的境界，无论以怎样的形式，总有一天都必须战斗……对吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
